<view class="lx-page"><view class="lx-orbit"></view><field-nav /><view class="lx-content">
  <view class="hero"><view class="lx-kicker">A LIVING DIGITAL FIELD</view><view class="lx-title">{{lang === 'en' ? 'Connect awareness with living reality' : '连接灵犀场，让意识与现实持续对齐'}}</view><view class="lx-subtitle">{{lang === 'en' ? 'Manifestation, relationships, dreams, time, practice and present choices meet in one living field.' : '意识显化、关系、梦境、时间、修炼、潜意识与当下选择，在场域中持续连接。'}}</view></view>
  <view class="lx-grid lx-section"><view wx:for="{{entries}}" wx:key="title" class="lx-card lx-veil" data-index="{{index}}" bindtap="enter"><view class="lx-card-title">{{lang === 'en' ? item.titleEn : item.title}}</view><view class="lx-card-note">{{lang === 'en' ? item.noteEn : item.note}}</view><view class="arrow">{{lang === 'en' ? 'ENTER →' : '进入 →'}}</view></view></view>
  <button class="website-entry" bindtap="openWebsite">{{lang === 'en' ? 'OPEN LINGXIFIELD WEBSITE →' : '进入灵犀场官网 →'}}</button>
  <view wx:if="{{exchanges.length}}" class="lx-section"><view class="lx-kicker">MANIFESTATION ACCESS</view><view class="lx-section-title exchange-title">{{lang === 'en' ? 'Manifestation subscription' : '意识显化订阅'}}</view><view class="lx-subtitle">{{lang === 'en' ? 'Choose one day, one month or one year. No automatic renewal.' : '可选择单日、月度或年度连接，不自动续费。'}}</view><view class="exchange-list"><view wx:for="{{exchanges}}" wx:key="productId" class="exchange lx-veil {{expandedProductId === item.productId ? 'expanded' : ''}}"><view class="exchange-summary" data-product="{{item.productId}}" bindtap="toggleExchange"><view class="exchange-heading"><view class="lx-card-title">{{lang === 'en' ? item.nameEn : item.name}}</view><view class="lx-card-note">{{lang === 'en' ? item.noteEn : item.note}}</view></view><view class="exchange-price">{{item.priceLabel}} {{expandedProductId === item.productId ? '⌃' : '⌄'}}</view></view><view wx:if="{{expandedProductId === item.productId}}" class="exchange-detail"><view class="exchange-description">{{lang === 'en' ? item.detailDescriptionEn : item.detailDescription}}</view><button class="lx-button exchange-action" data-index="{{index}}" catchtap="openExchange">{{lang === 'en' ? item.ctaEn : item.cta}}</button></view></view></view></view>
  <view class="lx-veil manifesto"><view class="lx-kicker">LINGXI FIELD</view><view class="lx-section-title">此刻，就是入口</view><view class="section-title-en">This moment is the entrance.</view><view class="lx-subtitle">灵犀场不替你决定方向。<br/><br/>因为真正的答案，<br/>一直存在于你与自己的连接之中。<br/><br/>这里提供观察的镜面、<br/>理解生命结构的路径，<br/>以及重新看见自己的空间。<br/><br/>每一次进入，<br/>都是一次与自身更深层连接的开始。</view><view class="manifest-en">Lingxi Field does not choose your direction for you. It offers a mirror, a path into life structure, and a place where you can meet yourself again.</view></view>
</view></view>
